<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10004] Parse error leads to leave the transaction</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10004</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;1. Start 2 nodes + connect sqlline&lt;br/&gt;
2. Execute following queries:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;create table t10 (a int, b varchar, primary key(a)) with &quot;ATOMICITY=TRANSACTIONAL_SNAPSHOT,backups=1&quot;;
begin;
insert into t10 values(1); &amp;lt;- wrong set
insert into t10 values(2, &apos;2&apos;); &amp;lt;- correct set
commit;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The output:&lt;/p&gt;
